	(text "Game Boy link  ->  3.5mm TRS analog clock adapter\n\n    Tip    (J1.3)  =  SC   serial clock\n    Ring   (J1.2)  =  SD\n    Sleeve (J1.1)  =  GND\n\nVDD / SO / SI are intentionally not connected.\nJ1 pin 4 (shunt) is normalled to the tip and is left\nfloating, so it cannot short SC when nothing is plugged in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
